    "Name": "Incorgnito ICO-QSC",
    "Details": "Weighing in at 30 tons each, the Incorgnito expands upon QuickSell's 'Clan Corgi' lineup, introducing a specialised unit for electronic warfare operations. Utilising the latest in QuikSell technology, the Incorgnito carries a variety of weight saving and electronic warfare equipment to support lances of Corgies while they move into biting range,all the while providing laser and missile support against aerial targets. Protect your Corgies with Incorgnito Pet Insurance today!!\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Quicksell Clan Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
